(6176455, 911420, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see the Starship Voyager in the clouds. Well, the Voyager has a bridge. It''s always struck me as kinda stupid that they put the bridge of the ship on the top, where it''s exposed and all the important crew members are easy to take out. Extra pointage for giving me an excuse for a random train of thought that really isn''t related to your entry.</td>', 'I see the Starship Voyager in the clouds. Well, the Voyager has a bridge. It''s always struck me as kinda stupid that they put the bridge of the ship on the top, where it''s exposed and all the important crew members are easy to take out. Extra pointage for giving me an excuse for a random train of thought that really isn''t related to your entry.', '2010-10-01 01:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
