(6176970, 908927, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A most unusual image - I don''t really understand the context; it seems anachronistic - a number elements seem strange to my eye. I think this is all good - it adds much interest to the image. On balance I think the toning works - it adds to the ambiguity of the image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I think there are a few blown highlights but other than that...<br/> <br/>Overall: An interesting image, I''m looking forward to seeing some context about this image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A most unusual image - I don''t really understand the context; it seems anachronistic - a number elements seem strange to my eye. I think this is all good - it adds much interest to the image. On balance I think the toning works - it adds to the ambiguity of the image. Critical stuff: I think there are a few blown highlights but other than that... Overall: An interesting image, I''m looking forward to seeing some context about this image.', '2010-10-01 11:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
