(6177136, 911068, 25024, '<td valign="top">Its quite an intriguing image but the focus is a bit soft and there are some highlights blown, and for me it would have worked better all mono but a good attempt, hope you do well with it.</td>', 'Its quite an intriguing image but the focus is a bit soft and there are some highlights blown, and for me it would have worked better all mono but a good attempt, hope you do well with it.', '2010-10-01 13:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
