(6177156, 910906, 25024, '<td valign="top">Its a nice landscape but the lighting is a bit harsh and there are some serious banding problems in the sky, good luck</td>', 'Its a nice landscape but the lighting is a bit harsh and there are some serious banding problems in the sky, good luck', '2010-10-01 13:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177161, 908425, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome motion blur.  I''m wondering if you used an nd filter, as it seems to be quite bright.  I love how the blur contrasts with all the sharp angles, and how the shadow remains so sharp - as if it were the shadow of a ghost, of a dimension shifter who is manifesting into this dimension.  Even the texture of the curb at the bottom is a treat.</td>', 'Awesome motion blur.  I''m wondering if you used an nd filter, as it seems to be quite bright.  I love how the blur contrasts with all the sharp angles, and how the shadow remains so sharp - as if it were the shadow of a ghost, of a dimension shifter who is manifesting into this dimension.  Even the texture of the curb at the bottom is a treat.', '2010-10-01 13:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177165, 909705, 96751, '<td valign="top">Magical.  I am finding that rotating an image might be the most splendid adjustment of all.  The diagonal line of the rocks is so interesting, and the upper and lower portions appear to be negatives of each other.  Beautifully seen and pp</td>', 'Magical.  I am finding that rotating an image might be the most splendid adjustment of all.  The diagonal line of the rocks is so interesting, and the upper and lower portions appear to be negatives of each other.  Beautifully seen and pp', '2010-10-01 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177172, 912150, 96751, '<td valign="top">I understand why you cropped this way, but it seems very severe and squashed to me.</td>', 'I understand why you cropped this way, but it seems very severe and squashed to me.', '2010-10-01 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177176, 909055, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just SO bizzare!! I''m guessing (hoping) this is some sort of outdoors theatrical presentation and not just a manifestation of a nightmare I had years ago!!! :-)</td>', 'This is just SO bizzare!! I''m guessing (hoping) this is some sort of outdoors theatrical presentation and not just a manifestation of a nightmare I had years ago!!! :-)', '2010-10-01 13:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
