(6177188, 912021, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a symbol of our culture''s disposable mentality.  Just throw it out when it gets old.  Doesn''t matter where it lands.  Stark and eloquent.</td>', 'Such a symbol of our culture''s disposable mentality.  Just throw it out when it gets old.  Doesn''t matter where it lands.  Stark and eloquent.', '2010-10-01 13:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
