(6177195, 912160, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I can''t imagine this won''t do well.  Exceptional clarity and dimensionality.  It''s like the Borg, moving through the galaxies and absorbing everything in its path.  Square crop is perfect.  A tiny nit is that the focus falls off in the upper right.</td>', 'Wow!  I can''t imagine this won''t do well.  Exceptional clarity and dimensionality.  It''s like the Borg, moving through the galaxies and absorbing everything in its path.  Square crop is perfect.  A tiny nit is that the focus falls off in the upper right.', '2010-10-01 13:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177199, 912211, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very meditational  Must a bit more depth and detail to the chairs, especially to contrast the smooth ocean of sand.</td>', 'Very meditational  Must a bit more depth and detail to the chairs, especially to contrast the smooth ocean of sand.', '2010-10-01 13:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177205, 912182, 96751, '<td valign="top">Glorious.  This looks like natural light?  I''ve seen this location before, and I have an idea of who this might be, but I''m usually wrong about that stuff.  Very nice art direction too, although in the reflection, the pose is not as appealing.  And the tilt weakens the image for me.  Still, stellar capture.</td>', 'Glorious.  This looks like natural light?  I''ve seen this location before, and I have an idea of who this might be, but I''m usually wrong about that stuff.  Very nice art direction too, although in the reflection, the pose is not as appealing.  And the tilt weakens the image for me.  Still, stellar capture.', '2010-10-01 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177209, 910386, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and pp!!!!  LOVE her skin<br/> <br/>I''m taking a studio lighting class right now, and I''m trying to diagnose images I really like.  Let''s see if I got it right:<br/> <br/>The key light is camera right, low<br/>fill light camera left, low<br/>fill/hair light (or bounce) behind her over her hips<br/> <br/>Hope you let me know how I did after roll over.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and pp!!!!  LOVE her skin I''m taking a studio lighting class right now, and I''m trying to diagnose images I really like.  Let''s see if I got it right: The key light is camera right, lowfill light camera left, lowfill/hair light (or bounce) behind her over her hips Hope you let me know how I did after roll over.', '2010-10-01 13:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177210, 912205, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a clean image.</td>', 'Such a clean image.', '2010-10-01 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
