(6177214, 912224, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous portrait, and the bg, though busy, is oddly pleasing, probably due to the contrast of its being oof with the sharpness and detail in the man.  Such an interesting face.  The composition is also very appealing.</td>', 'Fabulous portrait, and the bg, though busy, is oddly pleasing, probably due to the contrast of its being oof with the sharpness and detail in the man.  Such an interesting face.  The composition is also very appealing.', '2010-10-01 13:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
