(6177777, 911943, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Centered composition often doesn''t work well, but it does here - thirds empty all the way around, with him in the middle third. Great eyes and expression. Great use of the floor to draw the eye to the subject.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Centered composition often doesn''t work well, but it does here - thirds empty all the way around, with him in the middle third. Great eyes and expression. Great use of the floor to draw the eye to the subject.', '2010-10-01 21:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177783, 911422, 77196, '<td valign="top">Multnomah Falls, to be precise. Interesting choice of composition - most try to get in both falls, or place the bridge at the bottom of the shot. About the only time you see this perspective is with a couple of family members or friends in the foreground posing... Nice, deep colors, good detail.</td>', 'Multnomah Falls, to be precise. Interesting choice of composition - most try to get in both falls, or place the bridge at the bottom of the shot. About the only time you see this perspective is with a couple of family members or friends in the foreground posing... Nice, deep colors, good detail.', '2010-10-01 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177785, 909088, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great memories. Interesting idea for a wedding shot. The well lit background vs. the shaded foreground seem to compete.</td>', 'Great memories. Interesting idea for a wedding shot. The well lit background vs. the shaded foreground seem to compete.', '2010-10-01 22:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177786, 911987, 77196, '<td valign="top">These are very difficult to shoot - very shy birds (at least around here). Biggest drawback is the bird blends too much with the background. Nice focus, detail, and capture of a moving object.</td>', 'These are very difficult to shoot - very shy birds (at least around here). Biggest drawback is the bird blends too much with the background. Nice focus, detail, and capture of a moving object.', '2010-10-01 22:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
