(6177860, 911723, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nicely done! My top 5. <br/>So many colors and textures from the background to the foreground, and so much to study. Hope you didn''t get wet trying to get the shot.<br/>That wisp of a white cloud on the top right, and it''s reflection in the water look out of place and slightly distracting, but that''s Mother Nature for you :)<br/> <br/>I wonder who this could be?  :)<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=910001</td>', 'Wow! Nicely done! My top 5. So many colors and textures from the background to the foreground, and so much to study. Hope you didn''t get wet trying to get the shot.That wisp of a white cloud on the top right, and it''s reflection in the water look out of place and slightly distracting, but that''s Mother Nature for you :) I wonder who this could be?  :)//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=910001', '2010-10-01 23:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177876, 911952, 59796, '<td valign="top">Top 10 for sure.<br/>I''m getting better at recognizing Iceland''s landmarks thanks to all you wonderful photographers. As amazing a picture as I can remember ever seeing, of Dynosaur Rock. So how long did you have to stand still in the cold water? :)</td>', 'Top 10 for sure.I''m getting better at recognizing Iceland''s landmarks thanks to all you wonderful photographers. As amazing a picture as I can remember ever seeing, of Dynosaur Rock. So how long did you have to stand still in the cold water? :)', '2010-10-02 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177880, 912171, 59796, '<td valign="top">Phew! I hope this ribbons.<br/> <br/>For someone who hasn''t seen an aurora live, I can only envy all you Icelanders. Very well captured with an interesting foreground. The faraway houses and the tiny glowing chimney are slightly distracting, but I see them only after I spend a fair amount of time on the scene. Looks like it was windy too - with all the grass motion in the foreground. Worth your effort I must say.</td>', 'Phew! I hope this ribbons. For someone who hasn''t seen an aurora live, I can only envy all you Icelanders. Very well captured with an interesting foreground. The faraway houses and the tiny glowing chimney are slightly distracting, but I see them only after I spend a fair amount of time on the scene. Looks like it was windy too - with all the grass motion in the foreground. Worth your effort I must say.', '2010-10-02 00:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177881, 909859, 91783, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty! i hope that you do well. <br/> <br/>the colors and the sharpness are great and the DOF and POV is good!</td>', 'This is really pretty! i hope that you do well.  the colors and the sharpness are great and the DOF and POV is good!', '2010-10-02 00:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177886, 912171, 59267, '<td valign="top">Wow! spectacular northern light! love this!</td>', 'Wow! spectacular northern light! love this!', '2010-10-02 00:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177887, 907865, 59267, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality!</td>', 'Excellent quality!', '2010-10-02 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177888, 912019, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice dof and textures, but the image is just a little flat, lightingwise.</td>', 'Nice dof and textures, but the image is just a little flat, lightingwise.', '2010-10-02 00:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177889, 910244, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah, fisheye makes everything look exotic.  Fabulous symmetry and depth.  Really well done HDR (not a fan usually), and the people give a great perspective.  It is a portal to another world, another life, another dimension.  And it looks like the Time Tunnel.</td>', 'Yeah, fisheye makes everything look exotic.  Fabulous symmetry and depth.  Really well done HDR (not a fan usually), and the people give a great perspective.  It is a portal to another world, another life, another dimension.  And it looks like the Time Tunnel.', '2010-10-02 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177891, 911131, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great elements here.  Nice symmetry and lines, and great tones and lighting.  It''s the leaning towards me thing that makes me queasy....</td>', 'Great elements here.  Nice symmetry and lines, and great tones and lighting.  It''s the leaning towards me thing that makes me queasy....', '2010-10-02 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177893, 911909, 59267, '<td valign="top">Wow! is this another Pandora?</td>', 'Wow! is this another Pandora?', '2010-10-02 00:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177894, 910952, 96751, '<td valign="top">It''s HoverDog!  Some strong elements here, although I feel that the image is missing a little "pop" - tonally, it appears most of the image is in a tight range, except for the dog.  A little saturation boost in the ground, and maybe a bit more contrast might help.</td>', 'It''s HoverDog!  Some strong elements here, although I feel that the image is missing a little "pop" - tonally, it appears most of the image is in a tight range, except for the dog.  A little saturation boost in the ground, and maybe a bit more contrast might help.', '2010-10-02 00:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177896, 907785, 59267, '<td valign="top">Breath taking!</td>', 'Breath taking!', '2010-10-02 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177897, 911045, 96751, '<td valign="top">I usually love high contrast, but in this case, there is too much detail lost.  It feels like the pp was meant to enhance the sky more than the ground.</td>', 'I usually love high contrast, but in this case, there is too much detail lost.  It feels like the pp was meant to enhance the sky more than the ground.', '2010-10-02 00:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177899, 912103, 96751, '<td valign="top">Powerful pov, wonderful lighting and really great colors.  Nice art direction.  Could have used a teensy bit of light on camera right face.</td>', 'Powerful pov, wonderful lighting and really great colors.  Nice art direction.  Could have used a teensy bit of light on camera right face.', '2010-10-02 00:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177900, 912246, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness.  It took my eyes a minute to focus and figure out what the heck that blob was.  This is so wonderful.  I"m so there.  I can feel the sand oozing between my toes.  Everywhere I look there are goodies to enjoy - the foam, the streaks in the sand, the sun on the sand, and a pinky to tantalize us.  Fabulous.</td>', 'Oh my goodness.  It took my eyes a minute to focus and figure out what the heck that blob was.  This is so wonderful.  I"m so there.  I can feel the sand oozing between my toes.  Everywhere I look there are goodies to enjoy - the foam, the streaks in the sand, the sun on the sand, and a pinky to tantalize us.  Fabulous.', '2010-10-02 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177901, 912077, 96751, '<td valign="top">This brings back memories...</td>', 'This brings back memories...', '2010-10-02 00:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177902, 911904, 96751, '<td valign="top">I see this much better in b/w.</td>', 'I see this much better in b/w.', '2010-10-02 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177903, 907785, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so impossibly pastoral.  Looks so much like an image in country that I''d guess it''s the same photog.  Nature sure collaborated with you this day. Contre jour at it''s best: <i><b>golden</b></i> contre joure!</td>', 'This is so impossibly pastoral.  Looks so much like an image in country that I''d guess it''s the same photog.  Nature sure collaborated with you this day. Contre jour at it''s best: golden contre joure!', '2010-10-02 00:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177904, 910122, 96751, '<td valign="top">Boy, is it ever!</td>', 'Boy, is it ever!', '2010-10-02 00:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177905, 911872, 96751, '<td valign="top">This image is terrific but your title is FANTASTIC!!!!  I keep thinking there is too much negative space on either side, then I think it''s a triptych, then I think the visual area is too narrow, then I think this just perfect the way it is.  He looks tentative, hesitating before deciding whether to enter the darkness or just walk away.</td>', 'This image is terrific but your title is FANTASTIC!!!!  I keep thinking there is too much negative space on either side, then I think it''s a triptych, then I think the visual area is too narrow, then I think this just perfect the way it is.  He looks tentative, hesitating before deciding whether to enter the darkness or just walk away.', '2010-10-02 00:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177906, 909162, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you did with her eyes, but she could have starred in Zombieland...  Otherwise, nice lighting.</td>', 'Not sure what you did with her eyes, but she could have starred in Zombieland...  Otherwise, nice lighting.', '2010-10-02 00:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177907, 909533, 96751, '<td valign="top">These feats are simply astonishing.  How much space is there between those tail fins!!???</td>', 'These feats are simply astonishing.  How much space is there between those tail fins!!???', '2010-10-02 00:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177908, 912225, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so wonderful!  Another image that made me stop and explore to try and figure out what I was looking at.  What a rewarding journey.  Is she shy.  Is she sad?  Is she trying to read the menu?  So many thoughts generated by the terrific crop and pp.</td>', 'This is so wonderful!  Another image that made me stop and explore to try and figure out what I was looking at.  What a rewarding journey.  Is she shy.  Is she sad?  Is she trying to read the menu?  So many thoughts generated by the terrific crop and pp.', '2010-10-02 00:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177911, 911405, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is such a silent screen siren feel about this image.  In terms of technique, this is a masterpiece.  The lighting is fabulous, and the tonal range lush, although the bottom crop is just a teensy bit tight for me.  <br/> <br/>From a modeling pov, I have a couple of nits: her pose is rather awkward and stiff, with her left shoulder a bit raised, and her right arm positioned unnaturally.  Also, her mouth is a bit tight, and does not match the allure of her eyes.  Beautiful model.</td>', 'There is such a silent screen siren feel about this image.  In terms of technique, this is a masterpiece.  The lighting is fabulous, and the tonal range lush, although the bottom crop is just a teensy bit tight for me.   From a modeling pov, I have a couple of nits: her pose is rather awkward and stiff, with her left shoulder a bit raised, and her right arm positioned unnaturally.  Also, her mouth is a bit tight, and does not match the allure of her eyes.  Beautiful model.', '2010-10-02 00:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177912, 912063, 96751, '<td valign="top">So very lovely.  The orchids seem to be reaching for those lovely rays.</td>', 'So very lovely.  The orchids seem to be reaching for those lovely rays.', '2010-10-02 00:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177914, 912073, 91783, '<td valign="top">wow what a cool room! most likely an awesom old house too! Hope you do well!</td>', 'wow what a cool room! most likely an awesom old house too! Hope you do well!', '2010-10-02 00:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177931, 908129, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great shot of my house :-)</td>', 'Great shot of my house :-)', '2010-10-02 01:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177932, 912253, 96751, '<td valign="top">Really terrific.  Everything works here - the looks on the girls'' faces, the pov, the focus on the expressions, the lighting, all the bright and sharp colors.  the blur on the backflipper adds to the sense of motion.  Just wish you''d fixed the tilt....</td>', 'Really terrific.  Everything works here - the looks on the girls'' faces, the pov, the focus on the expressions, the lighting, all the bright and sharp colors.  the blur on the backflipper adds to the sense of motion.  Just wish you''d fixed the tilt....', '2010-10-02 01:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177940, 912070, 30364, '<td valign="top">yes.</td>', 'yes.', '2010-10-02 02:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177941, 907596, 30364, '<td valign="top">can''t not like this excellent street photograph. thanks.</td>', 'can''t not like this excellent street photograph. thanks.', '2010-10-02 02:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177942, 910812, 30364, '<td valign="top">simply good.  <br/>thanks.</td>', 'simply good.  thanks.', '2010-10-02 02:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
