(6178200, 910389, 96751, '<td valign="top">Pretty amazing! You were seriously lucky with that double rainbow.  Love the pp on this, as it works to highlight the best parts, while leaving an aura of mystery all around it.  Great location too, and the model knows what she''s doing.  Splendid!</td>', 'Pretty amazing! You were seriously lucky with that double rainbow.  Love the pp on this, as it works to highlight the best parts, while leaving an aura of mystery all around it.  Great location too, and the model knows what she''s doing.  Splendid!', '2010-10-02 13:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178214, 909414, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a terrific pov of my native city :-)</td>', 'Such a terrific pov of my native city :-)', '2010-10-02 14:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178216, 911818, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fun image!  Great wardrobe, and the flock wall is a wonderful detail.  Oddly, I''m ok with the upper body crop, but somehow the missing foot is disturbing.  And surely, with so much attention to detail, you could have found a more interesting footrest?  Nice, vibrant colors, but not a fan of the desat.  I honestly don''t think this image needed it.</td>', 'What a fun image!  Great wardrobe, and the flock wall is a wonderful detail.  Oddly, I''m ok with the upper body crop, but somehow the missing foot is disturbing.  And surely, with so much attention to detail, you could have found a more interesting footrest?  Nice, vibrant colors, but not a fan of the desat.  I honestly don''t think this image needed it.', '2010-10-02 14:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178217, 908401, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous eyes.  Just wish they were in focus :-)</td>', 'Gorgeous eyes.  Just wish they were in focus :-)', '2010-10-02 14:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178218, 911553, 96751, '<td valign="top">Drama in a flower.  Stunning.</td>', 'Drama in a flower.  Stunning.', '2010-10-02 14:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178219, 908238, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  What a pity you did not make full use of the 800 mp allowed!</td>', 'This is wonderful.  What a pity you did not make full use of the 800 mp allowed!', '2010-10-02 14:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178220, 912240, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, art!</td>', 'Ah, art!', '2010-10-02 14:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178221, 909304, 96751, '<td valign="top">So beautiful, but a bit oversharpened.  Instead of clarity, there is a chalkiness to the dew drops.</td>', 'So beautiful, but a bit oversharpened.  Instead of clarity, there is a chalkiness to the dew drops.', '2010-10-02 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178223, 910332, 96751, '<td valign="top">Natural symmetry at its best.  The lighting is fabulous, and I can only imagine that you were on top of your car to get this vantage point!  The trees are like sunbathers, leaning back in their beach chairs, soaking in the warmth of the setting sun.  Ok, it might be rising sun, but they still look like they''re enjoying it. Beautiful.</td>', 'Natural symmetry at its best.  The lighting is fabulous, and I can only imagine that you were on top of your car to get this vantage point!  The trees are like sunbathers, leaning back in their beach chairs, soaking in the warmth of the setting sun.  Ok, it might be rising sun, but they still look like they''re enjoying it. Beautiful.', '2010-10-02 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178224, 912066, 96751, '<td valign="top">So sweet!  I think this would be even better in b/w, with a touch more contrast.</td>', 'So sweet!  I think this would be even better in b/w, with a touch more contrast.', '2010-10-02 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178225, 912041, 96751, '<td valign="top">So THIS is what they mean by "eyes as big as saucers"!!  What a mug!</td>', 'So THIS is what they mean by "eyes as big as saucers"!!  What a mug!', '2010-10-02 14:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178227, 912039, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just marvelous. Although I''m guessing peas and not chrysalis... I am usually a big fan of negative space, but in this case it seems distracting.  A squarer crop seems more appropriate to me, and also a bit more breathing room beneath the sun and to the right of the twig.  Obviously not possible if shot this way :-)</td>', 'Just marvelous. Although I''m guessing peas and not chrysalis... I am usually a big fan of negative space, but in this case it seems distracting.  A squarer crop seems more appropriate to me, and also a bit more breathing room beneath the sun and to the right of the twig.  Obviously not possible if shot this way :-)', '2010-10-02 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178228, 912073, 96751, '<td valign="top">Man oh man.  This is not just a physical place, but an alternate dimension, a dream, an apparition.  It is both the arrival and departure room, the room with the answers, the room with the questions.  It is hideously stunning, and beautifully decrepit.  Where you walk through a door and float out a window, where you stare in, where you live and die.  <br/> <br/>Clearly, this image inspires me :-)  LOVE IT!!!</td>', 'Man oh man.  This is not just a physical place, but an alternate dimension, a dream, an apparition.  It is both the arrival and departure room, the room with the answers, the room with the questions.  It is hideously stunning, and beautifully decrepit.  Where you walk through a door and float out a window, where you stare in, where you live and die.   Clearly, this image inspires me :-)  LOVE IT!!!', '2010-10-02 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178229, 911240, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous use of blur.  Your choice of focusing the eye instead of the hand is brilliant.  We are being watched.  We are ALL being watched.</td>', 'Fabulous use of blur.  Your choice of focusing the eye instead of the hand is brilliant.  We are being watched.  We are ALL being watched.', '2010-10-02 14:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178230, 909456, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very dark image, in every sense of the word.</td>', 'A very dark image, in every sense of the word.', '2010-10-02 14:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178233, 911122, 96751, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is a leaf-peeping image I wish I''d seen.  The year we went was rated so-so by the locals.  Nary a red leaf to be seen.  Gorgeous, and perfectly pp''d.</td>', 'Now THIS is a leaf-peeping image I wish I''d seen.  The year we went was rated so-so by the locals.  Nary a red leaf to be seen.  Gorgeous, and perfectly pp''d.', '2010-10-02 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178236, 912166, 96751, '<td valign="top">OMG!  It''s Jonathan Livingston Cloudgull!!!!  Or a little narcissistic cloud, gazing and its considerable beauty reflected in the water.  Or a UFO cleverly disguised as a narcissistic little cloud.  Or...  I especially like that the reflection is even more vivid and beautiful the the real cloud - a phenomenon that seems to apply to people as well...<br/> <br/>Really well seen and nicely pp''d.  The trunks sticking out of the water provide unusual and effective framing.</td>', 'OMG!  It''s Jonathan Livingston Cloudgull!!!!  Or a little narcissistic cloud, gazing and its considerable beauty reflected in the water.  Or a UFO cleverly disguised as a narcissistic little cloud.  Or...  I especially like that the reflection is even more vivid and beautiful the the real cloud - a phenomenon that seems to apply to people as well... Really well seen and nicely pp''d.  The trunks sticking out of the water provide unusual and effective framing.', '2010-10-02 14:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178238, 912105, 96751, '<td valign="top">Evocative image.  Who knew dogs also liked sunsets.  This is an image that would have benefited from a generous crop off the top, to make it square.  Nothing is happening up there, and it draws our eye away from sharing the marvelous contemplative moment with the poochies...</td>', 'Evocative image.  Who knew dogs also liked sunsets.  This is an image that would have benefited from a generous crop off the top, to make it square.  Nothing is happening up there, and it draws our eye away from sharing the marvelous contemplative moment with the poochies...', '2010-10-02 14:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178240, 911042, 96751, '<td valign="top">Say WHAT???!!  If those aren''t cartoon eyes...  Love the gentle colors and the unusual subject.</td>', 'Say WHAT???!!  If those aren''t cartoon eyes...  Love the gentle colors and the unusual subject.', '2010-10-02 14:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178241, 912023, 96751, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a less straight-on angle would give this image a more dynamic feel.</td>', 'Perhaps a less straight-on angle would give this image a more dynamic feel.', '2010-10-02 14:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178243, 911724, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOVE the vintagy pp.  That gaze is mesmerizing.</td>', 'LOVE the vintagy pp.  That gaze is mesmerizing.', '2010-10-02 14:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178244, 912255, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous, although there is some ghosting around the balloons from one of your processing steps (not sure which, since I''m only just learning myself).  Excellent composition, and wonderful contrasts.  And I really love the sun, which seems to be beckoning to the balloon on the right.  The balloon is torn between staying with its partner, and embarking on a journey of mystery and light.<br/> <br/>Ok, I haven''t had breakfast yet...  Also, I didn''t see the sun until halfway through writing this, and I don''t think the image even needs it.  Although cropping it out would completely invalidate half my comment.<br/> <br/>Ok, now I''m just rambling.</td>', 'Fabulous, although there is some ghosting around the balloons from one of your processing steps (not sure which, since I''m only just learning myself).  Excellent composition, and wonderful contrasts.  And I really love the sun, which seems to be beckoning to the balloon on the right.  The balloon is torn between staying with its partner, and embarking on a journey of mystery and light. Ok, I haven''t had breakfast yet...  Also, I didn''t see the sun until halfway through writing this, and I don''t think the image even needs it.  Although cropping it out would completely invalidate half my comment. Ok, now I''m just rambling.', '2010-10-02 14:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178245, 907213, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sensational architectural abstract.  Gorgeous light, lines, shapes.  Very rich tonal range, and a sense of beckoning.  Hope you''ll share where this is.</td>', 'Sensational architectural abstract.  Gorgeous light, lines, shapes.  Very rich tonal range, and a sense of beckoning.  Hope you''ll share where this is.', '2010-10-02 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178246, 911829, 96751, '<td valign="top">I came back and bumped this up because I kept thinking about it.  Every time I wanted to move on, something else emerged from the blur to capture my attention.   Great street scene candid.</td>', 'I came back and bumped this up because I kept thinking about it.  Every time I wanted to move on, something else emerged from the blur to capture my attention.   Great street scene candid.', '2010-10-02 14:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178247, 911053, 96751, '<td valign="top">This has a real Jaime feel.  Spectacular bubbles.  I''m envious!</td>', 'This has a real Jaime feel.  Spectacular bubbles.  I''m envious!', '2010-10-02 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178248, 910336, 96751, '<td valign="top">All lines are conspiring towards the center.  Nice!</td>', 'All lines are conspiring towards the center.  Nice!', '2010-10-02 15:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178255, 911345, 96751, '<td valign="top">I am so frustrated by this image.  The wall is sensational.  Incredible detail, colors, and visually very interesting.  The model, however...<br/> <br/>I can''t help but look at this through my director eyes.  As the main subject, her pose is awkward, but worse, uninhabited.  There is no energy flowing out of her, either towards the camera, into the sword, anywhere.  There is simply no intention.  While we can''t help it if a model lacks talent, as photographers there are things we can do to make it appear like they do.  And why choose such an excellent backdrop if there is no interaction with it?  It''s like two images in one, and neither is supporting the other.<br/> <br/>Also, I think the low vantage point is not the best choice here.  It requires that you include a healthy portion of the rather uninteresting ground.  And from a story pov, it doesn''t inform the image.  On the other hand, if this had been taken from a higher pov looking slightly downward, it might have created a David and Goliath dynamic, and the wall would have had a purpose for being there. <br/> <br/>Take all this with a grain of sand.  Or salt. :-)</td>', 'I am so frustrated by this image.  The wall is sensational.  Incredible detail, colors, and visually very interesting.  The model, however... I can''t help but look at this through my director eyes.  As the main subject, her pose is awkward, but worse, uninhabited.  There is no energy flowing out of her, either towards the camera, into the sword, anywhere.  There is simply no intention.  While we can''t help it if a model lacks talent, as photographers there are things we can do to make it appear like they do.  And why choose such an excellent backdrop if there is no interaction with it?  It''s like two images in one, and neither is supporting the other. Also, I think the low vantage point is not the best choice here.  It requires that you include a healthy portion of the rather uninteresting ground.  And from a story pov, it doesn''t inform the image.  On the other hand, if this had been taken from a higher pov looking slightly downward, it might have created a David and Goliath dynamic, and the wall would have had a purpose for being there.  Take all this with a grain of sand.  Or salt. :-)', '2010-10-02 15:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178256, 911306, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great detail and energy, but could have used a bit of bounced light.</td>', 'Great detail and energy, but could have used a bit of bounced light.', '2010-10-02 15:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178257, 912243, 96751, '<td valign="top">Why, oh WHY do so many photogs dislike rays???  Wonderful.</td>', 'Why, oh WHY do so many photogs dislike rays???  Wonderful.', '2010-10-02 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178258, 912169, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  And I''m laughing bc the mantis seems to be posing - America''s Next Top Model??  LOL! Although in this image, he seems almost incidental.  I had no idea they came in so many colors!</td>', 'Stunning.  And I''m laughing bc the mantis seems to be posing - America''s Next Top Model??  LOL! Although in this image, he seems almost incidental.  I had no idea they came in so many colors!', '2010-10-02 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178260, 911609, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love enigmatic images.  In this case, I think the tilt could have been a bit stronger and added even more dynamics to an interesting capture.</td>', 'I love enigmatic images.  In this case, I think the tilt could have been a bit stronger and added even more dynamics to an interesting capture.', '2010-10-02 15:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
