(6178277, 912203, 96751, '<td valign="top">This image has "great bones".  Lots of terrific elements, and that weed is VERY Quixotic!  I think a squarer crop - eliminating most of the left side - would help.  Also, a bit more brightness.  There is an overall dullness which works against an intriguing capture.</td>', 'This image has "great bones".  Lots of terrific elements, and that weed is VERY Quixotic!  I think a squarer crop - eliminating most of the left side - would help.  Also, a bit more brightness.  There is an overall dullness which works against an intriguing capture.', '2010-10-02 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
