(6178297, 912230, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so very odd.  It is a technically very flawed image - horrible pixilation (intentional?), and absurd clarity, both.  I''m afraid the pixilation, though a bold choice, simply doesn''t work for me.  It is not the same as, or attractive as, blur.</td>', 'This is so very odd.  It is a technically very flawed image - horrible pixilation (intentional?), and absurd clarity, both.  I''m afraid the pixilation, though a bold choice, simply doesn''t work for me.  It is not the same as, or attractive as, blur.', '2010-10-02 15:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
