(6178322, 912121, 96751, '<td valign="top">!!!!  My other weakness: kitties.  This is one of my absolute favorite poses - little paws so elegantly placed together, tail wrapped around.  The off-camera gaze gives this a contemplative effect, of deep thought.  Well, as deep as a kitteh''s thoughts can go :-)  Lovely lighting, although this is a case where a little bit of selective desat on the grass would have reduced the distraction of its bold colors.</td>', '!!!!  My other weakness: kitties.  This is one of my absolute favorite poses - little paws so elegantly placed together, tail wrapped around.  The off-camera gaze gives this a contemplative effect, of deep thought.  Well, as deep as a kitteh''s thoughts can go :-)  Lovely lighting, although this is a case where a little bit of selective desat on the grass would have reduced the distraction of its bold colors.', '2010-10-02 16:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
