(6178341, 911238, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something sinister yet alluring about this image.  Don''t know what that dark thing in the foreground is, but I find it very distracting due to its prominent placement.  Otherwise, this is a killer image.</td>', 'There is something sinister yet alluring about this image.  Don''t know what that dark thing in the foreground is, but I find it very distracting due to its prominent placement.  Otherwise, this is a killer image.', '2010-10-02 16:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178345, 910133, 96751, '<td valign="top">We are meeting your baby in bits and pieces.  This is sensational.  I adore implied images, and in this case, I love how her shoulder seems to melt into the bg.  As though she is being absorbed or is emerging, or as if she is an apparition that is manifesting or dissolving.</td>', 'We are meeting your baby in bits and pieces.  This is sensational.  I adore implied images, and in this case, I love how her shoulder seems to melt into the bg.  As though she is being absorbed or is emerging, or as if she is an apparition that is manifesting or dissolving.', '2010-10-02 16:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178350, 910787, 96751, '<td valign="top">How lucky are YOU to do his portrait!!!  Love the colors, the casual pose, the lighting.  But that curtain placement is distracting, and the overhead lamp is superfluous.  I have it scrolled down to just below the edge of the lamp, and to my eye it improves the image.<br/> <br/>Kudos and congrats on your subject!</td>', 'How lucky are YOU to do his portrait!!!  Love the colors, the casual pose, the lighting.  But that curtain placement is distracting, and the overhead lamp is superfluous.  I have it scrolled down to just below the edge of the lamp, and to my eye it improves the image. Kudos and congrats on your subject!', '2010-10-02 16:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178351, 910781, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun, fun, fun!!  What the day lacked in pretty weather, you made up for with terrific energy.</td>', 'Fun, fun, fun!!  What the day lacked in pretty weather, you made up for with terrific energy.', '2010-10-02 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178353, 911774, 96751, '<td valign="top">Flood?  Infinity pool?  Love the tones here, and the figures add a powerful element.</td>', 'Flood?  Infinity pool?  Love the tones here, and the figures add a powerful element.', '2010-10-02 16:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178355, 911250, 96751, '<td valign="top">Don''t you adore polarizers????  Fabulous.</td>', 'Don''t you adore polarizers????  Fabulous.', '2010-10-02 16:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178357, 911332, 96751, '<td valign="top">These guys are going to LOVE their wedding shots.  Bravo for creating art from what can be a tedious series of "standard" wedding images.  I think the lighting on the farthest columns really makes this image by adding superb depth and complexity.  And helps us find the groom, who would otherwise be practically invisible.  As it should be :-)</td>', 'These guys are going to LOVE their wedding shots.  Bravo for creating art from what can be a tedious series of "standard" wedding images.  I think the lighting on the farthest columns really makes this image by adding superb depth and complexity.  And helps us find the groom, who would otherwise be practically invisible.  As it should be :-)', '2010-10-02 16:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
