(6178713, 908927, 94815, '<td valign="top">Where was this shot - at a museum? The guy on the left carries an M1 rifle used in WWII. The guy on the right is a Tech 6 but looks like 18 yrs old which would be impossible. The photo is ok but whe title doesn''t make much sense in the context of the old equipment and uniforms and smiling situation.</td>', 'Where was this shot - at a museum? The guy on the left carries an M1 rifle used in WWII. The guy on the right is a Tech 6 but looks like 18 yrs old which would be impossible. The photo is ok but whe title doesn''t make much sense in the context of the old equipment and uniforms and smiling situation.', '2010-10-03 00:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
