(6179904, 912027, 94241, '<td valign="top">There''s a very low frequency gradient to this image.  The left is brighter than the middle which is brighter than the right.  It feels a bit unbalanced because of it.</td>', 'There''s a very low frequency gradient to this image.  The left is brighter than the middle which is brighter than the right.  It feels a bit unbalanced because of it.', '2010-10-03 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6179907, 911122, 94241, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL colors.  :)<br/> <br/>I would suggest cropping off the bottom bit, right at the water''s edge.  I feel like the bottom greenery is acting as a bit of a barrier between me and the subject.  I also think that the wider aspect ratio would compliment the scene.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL colors.  :) I would suggest cropping off the bottom bit, right at the water''s edge.  I feel like the bottom greenery is acting as a bit of a barrier between me and the subject.  I also think that the wider aspect ratio would compliment the scene.', '2010-10-03 22:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6179913, 910944, 94241, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light!<br/> <br/>I think this feels a little bit visually off balance, because of the heavier shadow on the left than on the right.  Maybe crop this a little narrower?</td>', 'Gorgeous light! I think this feels a little bit visually off balance, because of the heavier shadow on the left than on the right.  Maybe crop this a little narrower?', '2010-10-03 22:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
