(6180278, 912104, 114233, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of thirds. Not just in the positioning of the birds but in the way the water''s edge is used to used to draw the eye back down to the Heron (I think). <br/>There is a wonderful flow in the shot as the eye constantly moves around the picture between the African Fish Eagle, it''s reflection, the Heron and the water''s edge.<br/>The Heron looks perfectly in focus and the eagle looks a touch soft, but that could be because of the sun''s light coming in from the right and shining on it''s softer feathers on the back of it''s legs.<br/>I would perhaps have cloned out the little imperfections on the shore line to keep it as smooth and simple as it could be - after all the whole shot shouts (or whispers) calmness and quietness.<br/>Lastly (but not your fault as all!) it would have been amazing to get the full ripples in the lower right and not just a portion of it.</td>', 'Brilliant use of thirds. Not just in the positioning of the birds but in the way the water''s edge is used to used to draw the eye back down to the Heron (I think). There is a wonderful flow in the shot as the eye constantly moves around the picture between the African Fish Eagle, it''s reflection, the Heron and the water''s edge.The Heron looks perfectly in focus and the eagle looks a touch soft, but that could be because of the sun''s light coming in from the right and shining on it''s softer feathers on the back of it''s legs.I would perhaps have cloned out the little imperfections on the shore line to keep it as smooth and simple as it could be - after all the whole shot shouts (or whispers) calmness and quietness.Lastly (but not your fault as all!) it would have been amazing to get the full ripples in the lower right and not just a portion of it.', '2010-10-04 05:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180309, 912182, 101668, '<td valign="top">I simply love this and that says something cause I am really old fashioned and not a fan of nudity. Great picture</td>', 'I simply love this and that says something cause I am really old fashioned and not a fan of nudity. Great picture', '2010-10-04 06:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
