(6180635, 911343, 113419, '<td valign="top">what a capture!  good work here!</td>', 'what a capture!  good work here!', '2010-10-04 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180638, 908728, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, this is the kind of shot if taken either early morning or late afternoon or if there were clouds to add interest to the sky and water it would have been better, as it is it is nice but lacks the punch you get from better lighting. I would also recommend cropping just a slight bit off the bottom and or cloning out the rock in the middle bottom and the sand in lower left corner so they do not distract form the shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice scene, this is the kind of shot if taken either early morning or late afternoon or if there were clouds to add interest to the sky and water it would have been better, as it is it is nice but lacks the punch you get from better lighting. I would also recommend cropping just a slight bit off the bottom and or cloning out the rock in the middle bottom and the sand in lower left corner so they do not distract form the shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-10-04 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180639, 909456, 60495, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to look at in this shot but I find myself wondering what I am supposed to look at, where should my focal point be. As I look for the focal point I get drawn into the brightness of the beam in the lower section and the darker upright on the left side instead of enjoying the shot. I love all the angles and lines I just wish there was maybe a main focal point used to drawn you into the shot. I like how the upper oval sections frames the windows in the building and maybe something like that may have been better than the entire scene.</td>', 'There is a lot to look at in this shot but I find myself wondering what I am supposed to look at, where should my focal point be. As I look for the focal point I get drawn into the brightness of the beam in the lower section and the darker upright on the left side instead of enjoying the shot. I love all the angles and lines I just wish there was maybe a main focal point used to drawn you into the shot. I like how the upper oval sections frames the windows in the building and maybe something like that may have been better than the entire scene.', '2010-10-04 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
