(6182895, 911524, 114934, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this higher but I would have loved to see her face..  Literal I know and a very nice photo that would have been better if we could connect with her a bit more.In my opinion of course.</td>', 'I would have rated this higher but I would have loved to see her face..  Literal I know and a very nice photo that would have been better if we could connect with her a bit more.In my opinion of course.', '2010-10-06 08:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183200, 912171, 60495, '<td valign="top">I am always so jealous of Northern Light photos, it is a sight I want to see some day. I love the processing on this shot, the tones of the building work beautifully with the lights. Nicely done, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I am always so jealous of Northern Light photos, it is a sight I want to see some day. I love the processing on this shot, the tones of the building work beautifully with the lights. Nicely done, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-10-06 12:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183239, 912095, 60495, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to use B&amp;W for a balloon burn shot. I am used to seeing the glowing colors in these type shots but I find the B&amp;W strangely compelling and interesting. I love how the B&amp;W accentuates the texture of the balloon and how the light from the burner is lighting the crowd up. Well captured and framed, good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting choice to use B&W for a balloon burn shot. I am used to seeing the glowing colors in these type shots but I find the B&W strangely compelling and interesting. I love how the B&W accentuates the texture of the balloon and how the light from the burner is lighting the crowd up. Well captured and framed, good luck in the challenge!', '2010-10-06 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183281, 912111, 60495, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool scene, If I could make a suggestion, I would crop in a little tighter to get rid of the legs of the table and the black edges and the items sticking into the frame. Those items just distract from the bottle and the rainy fall scene which to me are the focal points of the shot. Items that do not add to a photo tend to distract and get peoples attention away from the focal point of the photo. If I were to crop this shot I would crop the bottom up until the openings between the legs disappear, crop the right to where the gap between the table disappears and crop the left side and top to where the protrusions disappear. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty cool scene, If I could make a suggestion, I would crop in a little tighter to get rid of the legs of the table and the black edges and the items sticking into the frame. Those items just distract from the bottle and the rainy fall scene which to me are the focal points of the shot. Items that do not add to a photo tend to distract and get peoples attention away from the focal point of the photo. If I were to crop this shot I would crop the bottom up until the openings between the legs disappear, crop the right to where the gap between the table disappears and crop the left side and top to where the protrusions disappear. Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-10-06 12:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183318, 912145, 100831, '<td valign="top">There is a man who frequents times square dressed like this only he''s all disheveled looking. I like how you made the man the focal point with the crowd quite blurred and desaturated but I still wish I could see the front of him (or the backs of the crowd - that''s a joke). 8 from me. I like the story.</td>', 'There is a man who frequents times square dressed like this only he''s all disheveled looking. I like how you made the man the focal point with the crowd quite blurred and desaturated but I still wish I could see the front of him (or the backs of the crowd - that''s a joke). 8 from me. I like the story.', '2010-10-06 13:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
