(6183466, 910235, 59796, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for light houses at dawn/dusk :) Very nice texture and detail on the rocks. The artifacts on the sky colors are distracting a little bit, but the overall impression of the picture is a wow! My top 5 in this challenge. Also, I usually see this kind of shots with a long exposure - rendering the water smooth. Did you get to try that as well on this scene?</td>', 'I''m a sucker for light houses at dawn/dusk :) Very nice texture and detail on the rocks. The artifacts on the sky colors are distracting a little bit, but the overall impression of the picture is a wow! My top 5 in this challenge. Also, I usually see this kind of shots with a long exposure - rendering the water smooth. Did you get to try that as well on this scene?', '2010-10-06 15:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183467, 911915, 112292, '<td valign="top">Fantastic night scene.</td>', 'Fantastic night scene.', '2010-10-06 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183571, 912240, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: An interesting combination of objects to be sure and the vibrant coloration works well for the subject matter.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I think the lighting is rather harsh, leading to some blown highlights. The overall composition and subject mater confuses me a little.<br/> <br/>Overall: Interesting, but I confess I don''t really get it.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: An interesting combination of objects to be sure and the vibrant coloration works well for the subject matter. Critical stuff: I think the lighting is rather harsh, leading to some blown highlights. The overall composition and subject mater confuses me a little. Overall: Interesting, but I confess I don''t really get it.', '2010-10-06 16:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183582, 911609, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Lots to like here, the light and the consequent shadow, the texture on the ground, the simplicity of the overall composition. I think the white lines at the top of the image are important too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really.<br/> <br/>Overall: I really like this, an image that is more than the sum of it''s parts.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Lots to like here, the light and the consequent shadow, the texture on the ground, the simplicity of the overall composition. I think the white lines at the top of the image are important too. Critical stuff: Nothing really. Overall: I really like this, an image that is more than the sum of it''s parts.', '2010-10-06 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183586, 910787, 100393, '<td valign="top">Way to go!! I really like what you''ve done with him too.</td>', 'Way to go!! I really like what you''ve done with him too.', '2010-10-06 16:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183612, 908425, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like this, the sharp shaft of light, the shadows and the moving figure all hangs together really well. Very Nixtery - a good thing. What impresses me most, is the way you''ve balanced the image so well, great composition, just the right amount of blur, just the right amount of vignette.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very strong work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like this, the sharp shaft of light, the shadows and the moving figure all hangs together really well. Very Nixtery - a good thing. What impresses me most, is the way you''ve balanced the image so well, great composition, just the right amount of blur, just the right amount of vignette. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Very strong work.', '2010-10-06 16:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
