(6183835, 911871, 76335, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder if different framing, faster exposure, or even a different orientation to give the shadow more attention wouldn''t have worked better. Still a great shot.</td>', 'I have to wonder if different framing, faster exposure, or even a different orientation to give the shadow more attention wouldn''t have worked better. Still a great shot.', '2010-10-06 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
