(6184786, 911609, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Nice use of the long shadow to add depth to the photo.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Nice use of the long shadow to add depth to the photo.', '2010-10-07 14:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184787, 911560, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene, especially getting clear details in the performer with an obviously long exposure.</td>', 'Very cool scene, especially getting clear details in the performer with an obviously long exposure.', '2010-10-07 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184789, 911420, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool sky and perspective. The only thing that is really hurting this photo in my eyes is the halos around some objects (namely the signs) caused by the HDR technique.</td>', 'Very cool sky and perspective. The only thing that is really hurting this photo in my eyes is the halos around some objects (namely the signs) caused by the HDR technique.', '2010-10-07 14:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184835, 911491, 30861, '<td valign="top">Now, THAT''s a landscape that marches to its own drummer. Beautifully seen, framed, and rendered.</td>', 'Now, THAT''s a landscape that marches to its own drummer. Beautifully seen, framed, and rendered.', '2010-10-07 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184840, 911584, 110876, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the spots near the center of the steering wheel.  I get this sometimes when I have a UV filter on the lense.</td>', 'Too bad about the spots near the center of the steering wheel.  I get this sometimes when I have a UV filter on the lense.', '2010-10-07 15:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184851, 912233, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job catching the action. However, I think you could have done better with this without the distracting background elements. Either using a shallower depth of field, or maybe cropping tighter on the racer.</td>', 'Nice job catching the action. However, I think you could have done better with this without the distracting background elements. Either using a shallower depth of field, or maybe cropping tighter on the racer.', '2010-10-07 16:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184853, 911909, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo blows me away! The colors and overall mood are simply fantastic.</td>', 'This photo blows me away! The colors and overall mood are simply fantastic.', '2010-10-07 16:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184855, 910839, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful scene. Vibrant colors and perfect lighting.</td>', 'What a wonderful scene. Vibrant colors and perfect lighting.', '2010-10-07 16:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184866, 909605, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here (the use of leading lines), bu I don''t really care for the overall execution. Mainly, there is a very distracting background. Maybe if you could have used a motion blur technique to add a sense of action this could have turned out even better.</td>', 'I like the idea here (the use of leading lines), bu I don''t really care for the overall execution. Mainly, there is a very distracting background. Maybe if you could have used a motion blur technique to add a sense of action this could have turned out even better.', '2010-10-07 16:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184867, 910389, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some spectacular lighting and composition.</td>', 'Wow, that is some spectacular lighting and composition.', '2010-10-07 16:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184874, 911422, 114225, '<td valign="top">Multnomah Falls sure are beautiful. Unfortunately, the one thing that is really hurting this photo in my eyes is the crooked bridge.</td>', 'Multnomah Falls sure are beautiful. Unfortunately, the one thing that is really hurting this photo in my eyes is the crooked bridge.', '2010-10-07 16:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184896, 911053, 114225, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just how the light is hitting things, but it really feels like there is some extra glow in the photo. Did you do anything special in post processing to help that?</td>', 'Maybe it''s just how the light is hitting things, but it really feels like there is some extra glow in the photo. Did you do anything special in post processing to help that?', '2010-10-07 16:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184903, 912250, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details and colors.<br/>It looks like you used a bit of a vignette. I''m torn on it a bit, as it helps to draw in attention, but at the same time feels a little bit too tight around the elk.</td>', 'Great details and colors.It looks like you used a bit of a vignette. I''m torn on it a bit, as it helps to draw in attention, but at the same time feels a little bit too tight around the elk.', '2010-10-07 16:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184912, 911269, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the shot. I like how the colors of her clothes/hat really stick out against the colors of the scene. I do find myself wishing I could see more of the scene (wider crop) a bit.</td>', 'Nice idea for the shot. I like how the colors of her clothes/hat really stick out against the colors of the scene. I do find myself wishing I could see more of the scene (wider crop) a bit.', '2010-10-07 17:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184913, 911602, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition. Great use of depth of field and nice details.</td>', 'Very cool composition. Great use of depth of field and nice details.', '2010-10-07 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184916, 912238, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground and background to give this scene depth. Also, very nice job capturing the action. I don''t care for the top/bottom black space in this photo.</td>', 'Nice use of foreground and background to give this scene depth. Also, very nice job capturing the action. I don''t care for the top/bottom black space in this photo.', '2010-10-07 17:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184917, 912171, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! Very the northern lights bright enough to light the shack that well, or did you have to use an extra light source?</td>', 'Very nicely done! Very the northern lights bright enough to light the shack that well, or did you have to use an extra light source?', '2010-10-07 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6184920, 911491, 79562, '<td valign="top">Stunning, painterly.</td>', 'Stunning, painterly.', '2010-10-07 17:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
