(6184926, 908238, 79562, '<td valign="top">I really like this - I wish the image was a bit larger, though.  I''d like to be able to soak in the textures more.</td>', 'I really like this - I wish the image was a bit larger, though.  I''d like to be able to soak in the textures more.', '2010-10-07 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
