(6185022, 912166, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is really good - this sort of watery skyish landscape image wouldn''t normally push my buttons but somehow this one has something special. Great balance to the image I think.</td>', 'This is really good - this sort of watery skyish landscape image wouldn''t normally push my buttons but somehow this one has something special. Great balance to the image I think.', '2010-10-07 18:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185026, 912073, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Utterly wonderful coloration and light. I don''t know how you''ve managed to boost the tonal contrast whilst maintaining a diffused look but it really, really works. I''d love to see your workflow on this one. The room and the way you''ve composed the shot makes for a masterful image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Lovely stuff.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Utterly wonderful coloration and light. I don''t know how you''ve managed to boost the tonal contrast whilst maintaining a diffused look but it really, really works. I''d love to see your workflow on this one. The room and the way you''ve composed the shot makes for a masterful image. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Lovely stuff.', '2010-10-07 18:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185044, 911872, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Super shot with a great title! I really like the composition with the bilateral negative space. I like the way the light catches the glasses too. The stance of your subject and how it mirrors the lighting / shadow is a nice touch.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very effective image. I like it.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Super shot with a great title! I really like the composition with the bilateral negative space. I like the way the light catches the glasses too. The stance of your subject and how it mirrors the lighting / shadow is a nice touch. Critical stuff: Nothing really. Overall: A very effective image. I like it.', '2010-10-07 18:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185049, 912043, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very strong work.</td>', 'Very strong work.', '2010-10-07 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185060, 911986, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Brave image - I like it though, dreamy diffused colours and enough story to hold the viewers interest. Makes me want to know more about the scene.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Perhaps a tighter crop at the top?<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nice work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Brave image - I like it though, dreamy diffused colours and enough story to hold the viewers interest. Makes me want to know more about the scene. Critical stuff: Perhaps a tighter crop at the top? Overall: Very nice work.', '2010-10-07 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185061, 909116, 100393, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait work. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent portrait work. A 10 from me.', '2010-10-07 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185073, 911774, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Fascinating image, like something from a science fiction film. The blue coloration is wonderful - it is well served by the motion-blur smoothness. The figures exhibit just enough blur to make this really interesting.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very strong work - would look great on a wall.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Fascinating image, like something from a science fiction film. The blue coloration is wonderful - it is well served by the motion-blur smoothness. The figures exhibit just enough blur to make this really interesting. Critical stuff: Nothing. Overall: Very strong work - would look great on a wall.', '2010-10-07 19:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185092, 911968, 76335, '<td valign="top">This novel POV reminds us how beautiful our planet really is. Nice work.</td>', 'This novel POV reminds us how beautiful our planet really is. Nice work.', '2010-10-07 19:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
