(6185598, 912240, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lots I like here.  The cracked skull, the blushed cheek, the winged helmet for 50 bucks, the sword (which of course hacked of the arm), the jumble and the chroma-chaos.  All those mad juxtapositions, and the perfect title.  Thanks.</td>', 'Lots I like here.  The cracked skull, the blushed cheek, the winged helmet for 50 bucks, the sword (which of course hacked of the arm), the jumble and the chroma-chaos.  All those mad juxtapositions, and the perfect title.  Thanks.', '2010-10-07 23:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
