(6185787, 912124, 83313, '<td valign="top">I regret that I did not have time to finish voting the FS so that could have given this a 10. I shot an Mi-24 recently that is operated by the cold war air museum in Texas, but I did not get nearly such an awesome shot. Glad to see it made a 6, but it deserved better, IMO. It is getting faved now, however.</td>', 'I regret that I did not have time to finish voting the FS so that could have given this a 10. I shot an Mi-24 recently that is operated by the cold war air museum in Texas, but I did not get nearly such an awesome shot. Glad to see it made a 6, but it deserved better, IMO. It is getting faved now, however.', '2010-10-08 02:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
