(6186558, 911994, 108069, '<td valign="top">I have to agree that the colors are just too over the top. The weather vane is completely consumed by them, whereas in the original there was a nice, sharp subject that stood out against an interesting sky. I think this is one of those times that, though it was there for the taking, less is more.</td>', 'I have to agree that the colors are just too over the top. The weather vane is completely consumed by them, whereas in the original there was a nice, sharp subject that stood out against an interesting sky. I think this is one of those times that, though it was there for the taking, less is more.', '2010-10-08 19:34:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186569, 912124, 11854, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I gave this an 8 in voting.  I''ve been here quite a few years and I think each FS gets worse with the scoring. It''s been especially harsh lately. Still, it''s hard to complain about a 6.</td>', 'Great shot! I gave this an 8 in voting.  I''ve been here quite a few years and I think each FS gets worse with the scoring. It''s been especially harsh lately. Still, it''s hard to complain about a 6.', '2010-10-08 19:38:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186576, 912018, 108069, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what blown highlights sldpixel is talking about. There are no blown highlights. And I don''t know what the problem is with there not being enough color... just because you called it Fall?<br/> <br/>I do agree the border is a bit weird though. Either go letterbox or equidistant all the way around (at least for voters); or better, no border at all, especially with a shot like this, which doesn''t need it.<br/> <br/>With a shot this good you want to go as big as possible, so scrap the border altogether. And a black border doesn''t help the scene. Sorry to go on about the border. It''s a great shot and should have done a hell of a lot better.</td>', 'I don''t know what blown highlights sldpixel is talking about. There are no blown highlights. And I don''t know what the problem is with there not being enough color... just because you called it Fall? I do agree the border is a bit weird though. Either go letterbox or equidistant all the way around (at least for voters); or better, no border at all, especially with a shot like this, which doesn''t need it. With a shot this good you want to go as big as possible, so scrap the border altogether. And a black border doesn''t help the scene. Sorry to go on about the border. It''s a great shot and should have done a hell of a lot better.', '2010-10-08 19:42:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186587, 912252, 120058, '<td valign="top">Do you ever get cave spiders down there?</td>', 'Do you ever get cave spiders down there?', '2010-10-08 20:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
