(6186858, 909116, 68586, '<td valign="top">A great shot - and doubly so as it wasn''t taken on a DSLR - a good reminder of what can be achieved without carrying a ton of kit about.<br/> <br/>I really like this shot - my only real critique is about losing his foot - and maybe - just maybe I would have considered looking at it being more of a landscape crop rather than portrait.<br/> <br/>But still a great shot.</td>', 'A great shot - and doubly so as it wasn''t taken on a DSLR - a good reminder of what can be achieved without carrying a ton of kit about. I really like this shot - my only real critique is about losing his foot - and maybe - just maybe I would have considered looking at it being more of a landscape crop rather than portrait. But still a great shot.', '2010-10-09 07:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186859, 909533, 68586, '<td valign="top">Stunts like this are simply awesome - what consummate skill these pilots have - and a perfect capture</td>', 'Stunts like this are simply awesome - what consummate skill these pilots have - and a perfect capture', '2010-10-09 07:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186860, 911847, 68586, '<td valign="top">Run little fella - run !!<br/> <br/>D''oh  . . too late.<br/> <br/>It''s a bug eat bug world out there ..<br/> <br/>Great capture though !</td>', 'Run little fella - run !! D''oh  . . too late. It''s a bug eat bug world out there .. Great capture though !', '2010-10-09 07:17:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186861, 911405, 68586, '<td valign="top">Punchy shot - very good</td>', 'Punchy shot - very good', '2010-10-09 07:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186862, 911053, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - theres an almost fairy tale feel to this and a timelessness of laughter.<br/> <br/>Very nice shot and processing.</td>', 'Wonderful - theres an almost fairy tale feel to this and a timelessness of laughter. Very nice shot and processing.', '2010-10-09 07:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186864, 911131, 68586, '<td valign="top">Hey - love your new apartment Tim - although goodness only knows how Aimee is going to get those windows clean  :- )<br/> <br/>Love the processing.</td>', 'Hey - love your new apartment Tim - although goodness only knows how Aimee is going to get those windows clean  :- ) Love the processing.', '2010-10-09 07:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186866, 910320, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very powerful shot of these kids in their environment.<br/> <br/>Quite astonishing.</td>', 'Very powerful shot of these kids in their environment. Quite astonishing.', '2010-10-09 07:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186877, 911909, 121573, '<td valign="top">Wow, Allen...this is AMAZING! A big congrats to you on your red ribbon!! Bravo!</td>', 'Wow, Allen...this is AMAZING! A big congrats to you on your red ribbon!! Bravo!', '2010-10-09 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186881, 909116, 68546, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments <br/> <br/>In response to Jedusi''s very detailed comment - I did consider the foot in the composition but it did look better with it cropped out, I was very aware of the foot but it just felt better with the slight crop, it was almost like I''d squeezed him in with the full foot<br/>Included but as soon as it was slightly cropped it felt much more like a compositional choice and so worked better? It''s an interesting point though, I was expecting a lot more comments on the foot though<br/> <br/>I''ve had the g11 for a couple of months now and apart from the actual handelling being far more awkward then the 5d in terms of focus, etc.. The output quality is very good. I''d happily print the pictures at 20" and the quality would be great. The main advantage really is the off camera flash capability. It''s fantastic. <br/> <br/>Thanks again</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments  In response to Jedusi''s very detailed comment - I did consider the foot in the composition but it did look better with it cropped out, I was very aware of the foot but it just felt better with the slight crop, it was almost like I''d squeezed him in with the full footIncluded but as soon as it was slightly cropped it felt much more like a compositional choice and so worked better? It''s an interesting point though, I was expecting a lot more comments on the foot though I''ve had the g11 for a couple of months now and apart from the actual handelling being far more awkward then the 5d in terms of focus, etc.. The output quality is very good. I''d happily print the pictures at 20" and the quality would be great. The main advantage really is the off camera flash capability. It''s fantastic.  Thanks again', '2010-10-09 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186898, 911491, 14603, '<td valign="top">Congratulations,very powerful image.<br/> <br/>That break in the cloud showing the Rockies beyond is almost like a tear in a curtain that reveals a tantalising glimpse of another world beyond.<br/> <br/>Nicely worked.</td>', 'Congratulations,very powerful image. That break in the cloud showing the Rockies beyond is almost like a tear in a curtain that reveals a tantalising glimpse of another world beyond. Nicely worked.', '2010-10-09 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186905, 912034, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty.  I think early spring and fall are my favorite times of year for nature shots.  You can''t go wrong with an amber leaf.  I have one today too. :)</td>', 'This is so pretty.  I think early spring and fall are my favorite times of year for nature shots.  You can''t go wrong with an amber leaf.  I have one today too. :)', '2010-10-09 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186910, 912034, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is a comp about shadows, &amp; I think the voters don''t generally react well to what they can''t see. The elements of the leaf modeled by the sun are just enough to let me know what it is &amp; the moment of sharp detail is just enough to let me create the rest for myself. I give you points for understated minimalism, if there is such a thing. Looks like you had a very nice walk thru the park!</td>', 'This is a comp about shadows, & I think the voters don''t generally react well to what they can''t see. The elements of the leaf modeled by the sun are just enough to let me know what it is & the moment of sharp detail is just enough to let me create the rest for myself. I give you points for understated minimalism, if there is such a thing. Looks like you had a very nice walk thru the park!', '2010-10-09 09:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186917, 911491, 119747, '<td valign="top">The break in the clouds is just perfect.</td>', 'The break in the clouds is just perfect.', '2010-10-09 10:08:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186918, 910330, 119747, '<td valign="top">I agree with Jedusi, there''s enough going on in the photo to keep you interested for ages.</td>', 'I agree with Jedusi, there''s enough going on in the photo to keep you interested for ages.', '2010-10-09 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186926, 912034, 92847, '<td valign="top">Great light here. I love the Autumn colors.</td>', 'Great light here. I love the Autumn colors.', '2010-10-09 10:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186931, 912034, 11854, '<td valign="top">Your leaves did better than my baby! LOL! Great shadows in this!</td>', 'Your leaves did better than my baby! LOL! Great shadows in this!', '2010-10-09 10:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186954, 912251, 119747, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice shot I think. It seems a little bit out of focus though, but nice photo none the less.</td>', 'Quite a nice shot I think. It seems a little bit out of focus though, but nice photo none the less.', '2010-10-09 10:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186955, 909651, 119747, '<td valign="top">Should of done much better! Nice photo</td>', 'Should of done much better! Nice photo', '2010-10-09 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186957, 912019, 119747, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, and DOF :)</td>', 'Nice photo, and DOF :)', '2010-10-09 10:39:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186958, 912021, 119747, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, intriqued by the story behind it.</td>', 'Nice shot, intriqued by the story behind it.', '2010-10-09 10:40:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186967, 912194, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is stunning....the waterlily looks like an explosion of color- as when a water drops and it fans out. To compliment the waterlily is that the lilypad also has vibrant color radiating out from it''s center.  Beautiful clarity and lighting is spot on. Congrats on high placement as well.</td>', 'This is stunning....the waterlily looks like an explosion of color- as when a water drops and it fans out. To compliment the waterlily is that the lilypad also has vibrant color radiating out from it''s center.  Beautiful clarity and lighting is spot on. Congrats on high placement as well.', '2010-10-09 11:02:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186980, 911240, 43463, '<td valign="top">I would love to one day see a screever at work creating a sidewalk masterpiece! Judging from the picture the screever has in his/her hand they are recreating Vermeer''s Girl With the Pearl Earring. I like how you captured a sense of movement. It makes us feel like we are ''there'' watching the work unfold rather than it being a static shot. Great colors and lighting on this too.</td>', 'I would love to one day see a screever at work creating a sidewalk masterpiece! Judging from the picture the screever has in his/her hand they are recreating Vermeer''s Girl With the Pearl Earring. I like how you captured a sense of movement. It makes us feel like we are ''there'' watching the work unfold rather than it being a static shot. Great colors and lighting on this too.', '2010-10-09 11:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186988, 911491, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely stunning in the majestic beauty present. It truly looks like a painting rather than a photograph. The break in the clouds to let the mountain peak through is just perfect. I feel like I am viewing the first breath of the morning dawning on this woodland splendor. Very nicely composed and congrats on taking the blue.</td>', 'This is absolutely stunning in the majestic beauty present. It truly looks like a painting rather than a photograph. The break in the clouds to let the mountain peak through is just perfect. I feel like I am viewing the first breath of the morning dawning on this woodland splendor. Very nicely composed and congrats on taking the blue.', '2010-10-09 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186990, 911872, 119747, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome photo</td>', 'Wow, awesome photo', '2010-10-09 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6187055, 912034, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sometimes voters can''t see the leaves for the trees.<br/>but we can, and this is lovely.</td>', 'Sometimes voters can''t see the leaves for the trees.but we can, and this is lovely.', '2010-10-09 12:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
