(6187066, 912171, 52549, '<td valign="top">You had a lot of competition in this challenge, Örvar but my God is this a stunning image! Many congrats on the HM.</td>', 'You had a lot of competition in this challenge, Örvar but my God is this a stunning image! Many congrats on the HM.', '2010-10-09 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6187076, 912034, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and detail.</td>', 'Very nice light and detail.', '2010-10-09 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6187082, 910386, 101702, '<td valign="top">I never got the chance to comment during voting. This was one of my ribbon choices. I gave this a 9. Still a strong finish, so congrats for that. Raphaella is drop-dead gorgeous and you have captured her beautifully. I didn''t even notice this was a model you had used before so just went back to check the other entries. Sure enough, all 3 look completely different. I gave the other two a 10 and an 8, so clearly you and her have something good going on! LOL. On reflection though, although I scored this one in the middle, it''s my favourite of the 3!</td>', 'I never got the chance to comment during voting. This was one of my ribbon choices. I gave this a 9. Still a strong finish, so congrats for that. Raphaella is drop-dead gorgeous and you have captured her beautifully. I didn''t even notice this was a model you had used before so just went back to check the other entries. Sure enough, all 3 look completely different. I gave the other two a 10 and an 8, so clearly you and her have something good going on! LOL. On reflection though, although I scored this one in the middle, it''s my favourite of the 3!', '2010-10-09 12:54:47.000000', NULL, 0),
