(6187402, 911986, 69668, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a painting I have...and love.  Nice image.  Gave you a 7...would have been higher with a bit of cropping off the top...otherwise, I really like it....ALOT!</td>', 'Reminds me of a painting I have...and love.  Nice image.  Gave you a 7...would have been higher with a bit of cropping off the top...otherwise, I really like it....ALOT!', '2010-10-10 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6187502, 911467, 67697, '<td valign="top">What an incredibly adorable dress!  I agree with Alicia, it probably needed more contrast for a FS.  Plus, if you look, she''s not really engaging the viewer - she''s interacting with someone to the left.  For a family memento tho, this is awesome!</td>', 'What an incredibly adorable dress!  I agree with Alicia, it probably needed more contrast for a FS.  Plus, if you look, she''s not really engaging the viewer - she''s interacting with someone to the left.  For a family memento tho, this is awesome!', '2010-10-10 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
