(6187535, 911240, 27605, '<td valign="top">Love this one, the lensbaby sure worked it''s magic.  I like the way the bottom right is anchored with that electric blue, and the way the saturated chalk pieces are scattered along the left side... the veins in his hand and the faint tattoos on his arm.  Artistry, Mr. B.  Wish you''d included your comments about the when and where.  Congrats on the finish.</td>', 'Love this one, the lensbaby sure worked it''s magic.  I like the way the bottom right is anchored with that electric blue, and the way the saturated chalk pieces are scattered along the left side... the veins in his hand and the faint tattoos on his arm.  Artistry, Mr. B.  Wish you''d included your comments about the when and where.  Congrats on the finish.', '2010-10-10 12:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6187545, 909230, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite marvelous!  Excellent comments and a great commenter average, too.  I''d say this was a success!</td>', 'Quite marvelous!  Excellent comments and a great commenter average, too.  I''d say this was a success!', '2010-10-10 12:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
