(6216015, 912124, 86218, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. in your face and the only thing that would improve this is to have a lower blade in the fore and stronger nose angle. This is however just as powerfull and "agressive" with the pilots frontal and all the grass flying around. You did great with this shot. Next time ask them to put some missiles on as well. :)<br/> <br/>Edit for spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-08 05:21:06.</i></td>', 'Really cool shot. in your face and the only thing that would improve this is to have a lower blade in the fore and stronger nose angle. This is however just as powerfull and "agressive" with the pilots frontal and all the grass flying around. You did great with this shot. Next time ask them to put some missiles on as well. :) Edit for spelling', '2010-11-08 05:20:26.000000', '2010-11-08 05:21:06.000000', 0),
